         <description>
            <p>
                The repository provides a set of improved Pixinsight scripts from various authors as well as some newly written scripts.
            </p>
            <p>
               Updates:
               <br/>
               Astro Bucket List 0.33.2 fixes save and backup handling in iCloud Drive by preserving filenames instead of renaming files during replacement. Saved contents are verified, and failed saves retain local recovery copies. Startup now clearly reports missing or unreadable remembered collections. Documentation has been updated.
            </p>
